2026-11-26T15:34:11.8701546Z 
2026-11-26T15:34:11.8701819Z cosign_executable_name=cosign
2026-11-26T15:34:11.8702116Z bootstrap_executable_name=cosign-bootstrap
2026-11-26T15:34:11.8702427Z 
